{"shortDescription":"The Polish zloty and Hungarian forint firmed on Thursday and bond yields pulled back from recent highs, as markets looked for signals from the United States about whether the Federal Reserve will raise rates this month.","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The Polish zloty and Hungarian forint firmed on Thursday and bond yields pulled back from recent highs, as markets looked for signals from the United States about whether the Federal Reserve will raise rates this month."]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Several Fed officials have indicated in recent days that they felt that a rate hike would be appropriate should inflation pressures continue. Fed Governor Christopher Waller is due to speak at 1230 GMT."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["\"CEE currencies will be affected by core markets,\" said Mateusz Sutowicz, senior economist at ING in Poland. \"We will be closely looking at Chris Waller, the Fed member's speech, as the market is trying to get the outlook for the Fed meeting in the middle of this month.\""]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Sutowicz added that markets were also waiting for Friday's U.S. nonfarm payrolls data."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The Polish zloty ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"OANDA:EURPLN","text":"OANDA:EURPLN"}}," was 0.2% firmer at 4.3225 per euro at 0833 GMT while the Hungarian forint ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"FX:EURHUF","text":"FX:EURHUF"}}," gained 0.3% to trade at 366.90."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["\"Geopolitical news is moving the rate today,\" said an FX trader in Budapest. \"Yesterday there was a big weakening but as soon as the forint touched the 200-day moving average, forint buyers appeared and it fell back from 371 to 368.\""]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["\"Today, there is more strengthening, after positive words from Putin on a chance for peace, and that is helping.\""]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Russian President Vladimir Putin said on Thursday that there is a chance of a peace agreement to end the war in Ukraine."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Polish benchmark 10-year bond yields (PL10YT=RR) tracked core markets, falling nine basis points to 6.0670% after hitting a three-year high on Wednesday. Czech 10-year yields (CZ10YT=RR) fell five basis points to 5.0969%."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["This followed a fall in U.S. Treasury yields on Wednesday."]}]},{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"p","children":["The Czech crown ",{"type":"symbol","params":{"symbol":"OANDA:EURCZK","text":"OANDA:EURCZK"}}," was flat after wage data showed real monthly wages rose by 4.3% year-on-year in the second quarter, lower than expected."]}]}]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"colspan":3},"children":[{"type":"p","children":["CEE MARKETS SNAPSHOT AT 1033 CET"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}},{"type":"table-data-cell","params":{"hidden":true}}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["CURRENCIES"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Latest trade"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Previous close"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Daily change"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Change in 2026"]}]}]},{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"p","children":["Czech crown"]}]},{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type